<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>File</h1>
<p>There is no file command any more, and none is needed. It used to reload 
the wizlist, news, credits, message of the day and info texts from disk 
after you changed them.
</p><p>Today the game reads each of these texts from disk every time someone 
asks for it: just edit the file in etc/strings (motd, news, wizlist, 
credits), and the next player to type <a cmd='#'>motd</a>, <a cmd='#'>news</a>, <a cmd='#'>wizlist</a> or 
<a cmd='#'>credits</a> sees the new text. No reboot is needed.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Wizlock</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help News</a>
</pre>




</div>